<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH LEAGUE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Scottish league matches</p>
<p>on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p>East Fife v Greenock Morton - postponed</p>
<p>Division two</p>
<p>Hamilton v Brechin, Clyde v Stranraer - postponed</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Montrose    1     East Stirling     0</p>
<p>Postponed: Alloa v Albion.</p>
</text>
